WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.536
It was an early fall morning.

2
00:00:23.537 --> 00:00:27.682
The air was chilly.

3
00:00:27.683 --> 00:00:33.897
Kip rubbed his paws to keep warm.

4
00:00:33.898 --> 00:00:35.633
Kip looked down.

5
00:00:35.634 --> 00:00:40.001
Bird was doing something in her nest.

6
00:00:40.002 --> 00:00:43.827
Kip didn't see what it was.

7
00:00:43.828 --> 00:00:49.738
He could only see something green and yellow.

8
00:00:49.739 --> 00:00:53.463
"Hey, Bird!" said Kip.

9
00:00:53.464 --> 00:00:58.262
"What are you doing?"

10
00:00:58.263 --> 00:01:00.866
"Nothing," said Bird.

11
00:01:00.867 --> 00:01:03.975
Kip climbed down to Bird's branch.

12
00:01:03.976 --> 00:01:09.942
"Can I see?" asked Kip.

13
00:01:09.943 --> 00:01:15.766
"No," said Bird.

14
00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:20.386
Bird turned her back to Kip.

15
00:01:20.387 --> 00:01:25.941
"Come on," said Kip.

16
00:01:25.942 --> 00:01:35.332
"Tell me what you're doing."

17
00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:38.032
"No," said Bird.

18
00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:41.421
"Please?" said Kip.

19
00:01:41.422 --> 00:01:52.276
"No," said Bird. "I'm not telling you."

20
00:01:52.277 --> 00:01:58.421
Kip tried to peek around Bird.

21
00:01:58.422 --> 00:02:03.829
Bird moved to the side.

22
00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:09.108
Kip tried to peek over Bird.

23
00:02:09.109 --> 00:02:15.088
Bird raised her shoulders.

24
00:02:15.089 --> 00:02:19.184
"Why won't you tell me?" asked Kip.

25
00:02:19.185 --> 00:02:22.032
Bird got angry.

26
00:02:22.033 --> 00:02:26.607
"Because it's a secret, Kip!" cried Bird.

